The most recent version of the BMW 3 Series is the G20/G21 generation, which received a facelift (LCI) for the 2023 model year. The '330' designation typically refers to the 330i (petrol) or 330d (diesel) engine variants. The M Sport trim is a popular package available with these engines. This evaluation focuses primarily on the 330i M Sport, as it is widely available and reviewed.

